[00:31.38]I know I stand in line
{"我知道我一直在等待"}
[00:33.35]Until you think you have the time
{"直到你觉得有空闲时光"}
[00:35.47]To spend an evening with me
{"与我共度一个夜晚"}
[00:40.00]And if we go someplace to dance
{"如果我们去某个地方跳舞"}
[00:42.60]I know that there's a chance
{"我知道或许有机会"}
[00:44.23]You won't be leaving with me
{"你不会独自离开"}
[00:46.97]Then  afterwards we drop into a quiet little place
{"之后我们走进一间安静的小店"}
[00:52.95]And have a drink or two
{"喝上一两杯"}
[00:57.82]And then I go and spoil it all
{"然后我又搞砸了一切"}
[00:59.84]By saying something stupid
{"说了些愚蠢的话"}
[01:01.76]Like I love you
{"比如我爱你"}
[01:06.30]I can see it in your eyes
{"我能从你眼中看出"}
[01:08.48]That you despise the same old lines
{"你厌倦了这些老套台词"}
[01:10.39]You heard the night before
{"昨夜已听过太多"}
[01:15.02]And though it's just a line to you
{"虽然对你只是陈词滥调"}
[01:17.35]For me it's true
{"对我却是真心话"}
[01:18.52]And never seemed so right before
{"从未感觉如此正确过"}
[01:23.96]I practice every day to find some clever
{"我每天练习寻找些聪明"}
[01:26.70]Lines to say
{"的台词诉说"}
[01:27.76]To make the meaning come true
{"让心意真实传达"}
[01:32.68]But then I think I'll wait until the evening
{"但后来我想等到夜深"}
[01:35.85]Gets late
{"时分"}
[01:36.57]And I'm alone with you
{"与你独处之时"}
[01:41.40]The time is right
{"此刻正是良机"}
[01:42.57]Your perfume fills my head
{"你的香气萦绕我脑海"}
[01:44.18]The stars get red
{"星光染上绯红"}
[01:45.30]And oh the night's so blue
{"夜色如此忧郁"}
[01:50.15]And then I go and spoil it all
{"我却偏要破坏这美好"}
[01:52.29]By saying something stupid
{"说出那些蠢话"}
[01:54.09]Like I love  you
{"比如我爱你"}
[02:29.39]I love  you...
{"我爱你……"}
